=== ROOM 53: THE NETWORK PROBE ===

A signal is being transmitted from a remote beacon.
Verify connectivity, trace the route, and retrieve the transmission.

MISSION:
1. Test connectivity: ping -c 3 127.0.0.1
2. Trace route: traceroute 127.0.0.1  (or: tracepath 127.0.0.1)
3. Start the local beacon server: ./start_server.sh
4. Retrieve the secret: wget -q -O - http://127.0.0.1:9053/key.txt
5. The content of key.txt IS the password for the next room

KEY COMMANDS:
   ping -c 3 host         Send 3 ICMP packets
   ping -W 2 host         2 second timeout per reply
   traceroute host        Trace hops to destination
   tracepath host         Alternative (no root needed)
   wget URL               Download from URL
   wget -O - URL          Output to stdout
   wget -q URL            Quiet mode
   wget --spider URL      Check URL exists without downloading
   curl -s URL            Alternative: curl silent to stdout

To decrypt room_54 when you have the password:
   openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -a -pbkdf2 \
     -in ../room_54/README -out ../room_54/README.txt -pass pass:PASSWORD
   cat ../room_54/README.txt
